'''Bears Be Back''' (レインボークマトーク, ''Reinbō Kuma Tōku'', '''Rainbow Bear Talk''') are a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Bears Be Bare]] introduced in [[Bears Be Back (Monthly Event)|Bears Be Back]], and appearing in [[Zero Legends]]. They were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

